# Loinnir's board test (D174 section 5): the same program as boot-venus's, an
# app of the board's images, started by `echo start loinnir-test >/svc/launcher/ctl`
# (board-test does). On a GPU whose driver host offers `csf` it draws on the
# core's Mali backend and says `loinnir-test: ok: Loinnir drew a triangle on the
# core`; with none, on Vulkan if there is one.
service loinnir-test
program loinnir-test
app loinnir-test
mount /dev devmgr/dev
